apiVersion: kpt.dev/v1
kind: Kptfile
metadata:
  name: datapath-actuator
  annotations:
    config.kubernetes.io/local-config: "true"
info:
  description: |
    The edge datapath control layer, delivered the pure-Nephio way (a blueprint fanned out per site by
    the EdgeSite controller, Config-Synced to the site's cluster) — NOT a bash/Makefile install. It
    carries the UPFDataPath CRD + the per-node sdcore-datapath DaemonSet that continuously reconciles
    each UPFDataPath CR (emitted by the edge-site blueprint) to the real host + BESS datapath. This is
    the "distributed actuation" that makes the UE ping self-healing (bridges/routes/ARP/accessRoutes),
    with no imperative bring-up. Cluster-scoped infra: exactly one instance per cluster.
